; After LoopRotate the row pointers of this floyd warshall kernel are header
; arguments (stepped pointers) next to the same addresses computed from the
; counter in the loop body (base + k * row size). They are the same value in
; every iteration, so LoopSimplify replaces the computed ones by the header
; arguments. LVN then sees one address per element, the second loads of p[i][k]
; and p[k][j] go away and the conditional becomes a single smin.
